                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75d48189-48a8-359f-a0e3-0ea0dbf645e8",
                        "entry_id": "62eadef9-a0df-378c-a200-e30ef8d62e84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Médicament antiparasitaire contre les helminthes (chez l'homme, l'animal ou la plante)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Pharmacie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce678c93-b500-4821-9ec5-ddff42c0f2f5",
                                "sense_id": "75d48189-48a8-359f-a0e3-0ea0dbf645e8",
                                "text": "La ressemblance de ces graines avec les cucurbitins a probablement donné l’idée de chercher en elles un anthelminthique, car Tyson ajoute: « Ceux qui croient que les simples portent le sceau des maladies qu’elles guérissent, trouveront dans ce fait un argument en faveur de leur opinion »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8f23f3a-377a-4073-b30e-a5934611dac7",
                        "source_entry_id": "62eadef9-a0df-378c-a200-e30ef8d62e84",
                        "source_sense_id": "75d48189-48a8-359f-a0e3-0ea0dbf645e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthelminthikum",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a61c5f37-19e5-48c4-8e62-89085693b82e",
                        "source_entry_id": "62eadef9-a0df-378c-a200-e30ef8d62e84",
                        "source_sense_id": "75d48189-48a8-359f-a0e3-0ea0dbf645e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthelmintic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthelmintic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3af73064-122a-34ed-a5da-67aab27f9ee4",
                                        "entry_id": "e9cfedf6-8cab-3613-b705-d749f5f7b572",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Destructive to parasitic worms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6be741e-846d-45a9-b2bb-a35ccb71110a",
                                                "sense_id": "3af73064-122a-34ed-a5da-67aab27f9ee4",
                                                "text": "Research is progressing well on finding native plants with anthelmintic properties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eeb620f5-039c-47d6-be31-a67857c8451c",
                                                "sense_id": "3af73064-122a-34ed-a5da-67aab27f9ee4",
                                                "text": "The parasites thrive in an environment of dirt, and the main lines of precaution are those dictated by sanitary science. Malefern, santonine, thymol and other anthelmintic remedies are prescribed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9d58d2b-b62e-4ded-84ce-261835bf5ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "3af73064-122a-34ed-a5da-67aab27f9ee4",
                                                "text": "However, the lighter boiling constituents of tne oil are much less irritating and at the same time they are apparently more anthelmintic than the heavier fraction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf56a135-1fcf-42ac-8474-095c389819a7",
                                                "sense_id": "3af73064-122a-34ed-a5da-67aab27f9ee4",
                                                "text": "Our experiments indicate that this constituent is anthelmintic and also a gastrointestinal irritant, while the lighter portion of the oil is apparently even more anthelmintic and much less irritating."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthelmintic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "098f1231-f5cd-3d8c-bf57-03cc02718e0d",
                                        "entry_id": "3e2fe7ad-45fa-3203-aa47-9a92670439ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A drug for the treatment of worm infestation, either by killing the worms or by causing them to be expelled from the body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed70001-a194-4d0f-88bf-45dc5f7e7c03",
                                                "sense_id": "098f1231-f5cd-3d8c-bf57-03cc02718e0d",
                                                "text": "The bark of the root is likewise valued as an anthelmintic in cases of tape-worm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab6048ec-c52d-476f-81cf-d15455597598",
                                                "sense_id": "098f1231-f5cd-3d8c-bf57-03cc02718e0d",
                                                "text": "Rather than give a long list of the anthelmintics available, I will describe the helminths that cause problems and then suggest methods of control."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
